        <div class="welcome">WELCOME TO</div>
        <h2>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h2>
        <p>Welcome to DHS Multispecialty Hospital, your trusted hospital partner in Ahmedabad. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is a state-of-the-art advanced multispecialty hospital located in Vastrapur. DHS is a one-stop solution for secondary and tertiary care providing medical and surgical treatments. DHS Multispecialty Hospital has fully equipped 50 beds with 24x7 ICU & Emergency services providing exceptional medical services.</p>
        <p>DHS Multispecialty Hospital focuses on providing patient-centric care and transparency in the hospital process. After 5+ years of providing comprehensive medical services, DHS hospital proudly stands out for its cutting-edge infrastructure and personalised treatment. Having treated 25,000+ indoor and 100,000+ outdoor patients, we have carved a niche among hospitals in Ahmedabad.</p>
        <p>At DHS Multispecialty Hospital, your health is our top priority and we strive to deliver the highest standards of care in a comfortable and supportive environment.</p>
        <p>Our Hospital is accredited by NABH, reflecting our dedication to quality, safety, and continuous improvement.</p>
        <p>DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers Mediclaim & Cashless services from major insurance companies for patient's ease.</p>
        <p>In addition, DHS Multispecialty Hospital also offers healthcare-related services like Health Check-Up, Endoscopy, Dialysis, Day Care Services for chemotherapy and Orthopedic treatments, and ICU care. Diagnostic services of Pathology and Radiology support all medical and surgical treatment.</p>
